includes: The broadcast pillar arrives. Tools ▸ Broadcast: pick RTMP or SRT, paste your YouTube/Twitch/TikTok/custom ingest URL + stream key, and Go Live — straight from the phone, no laptop and no OBS. It's also a first-class routing destination: in the patchbay, connect a source to Broadcast (RTMP/SRT) to arm it on demand (last connection removed stops it). Settings persist on-device; the stream key is stored securely and never logged. Honest about state: the streaming engine (HaishinKit) integration is the next isolated step, so for now Broadcast saves your destination and shows clear status rather than faking a live stream — destination + routing ship now, the A/V path lands next. Also new this batch: a "VJ / visual / broadcast bridge" guide (docs) showing how Echoel already drives Resolume / TouchDesigner / OBS / lighting / spatial rigs over OSC · Art-Net/sACN · ADM-OSC · MIDI — the body as the source the pro tools lack. Verified: Xcode Compile Check + CI green.
